editor_description = "The map's navmesh, baked in 160 m zones (PropKit). The template: agent radius 1 m (a body of 0.5 m plus NavService's 0.5 m box clearance), climb 3 m and slope 85 degrees (the land is walked as flat: every ground triangle of Terrain.is_on_ground is walkable), static colliders of the nav_source group on layer 1 (the trees are on layer 8: they cut it as props). Every zone bakes from -50 m to 400 m (a crater digs below the land), so the pieces meet the same after the ground moves. Bake: «Bake» on this node."
